        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>语文练习题</title>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"宋体\", serif;\n    background-color: #f4f9ff;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 20px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .page-container {\n    background-color: #fff;\n    width: 800px;\n    padding: 50px;\n    border: 2px dashed #a0c8e0;\n    border-radius: 15px;\n    position: relative;\n    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n  }\n  .header-tag {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 30px;\n    right: 30px;\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    width: 50px;\n    height: 50px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-family: \"SimHei\", \"黑体\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .section-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    font-family: \"SimHei\", \"黑体\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background-color: #eee;\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    padding: 5px 10px;\n    margin-right: 10px;\n    height: 30px;\n  }\n  .question-block {\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    font-size: 16px;\n  }\n  .options-row {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 50px;\n    margin-left: 25px;\n    margin-top: 5px;\n  }\n  .handwritten {\n    font-family: \"Kaiti\", \"楷体\", cursive;\n    color: #2c3e50;\n    font-size: 18px;\n  }\n  .pill-container {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 20px;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin: 20px 0;\n  }\n  .pill {\n    background-color: #e6f2ff;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 5px 20px;\n    border: 1px solid #b3d9ff;\n    font-family: \"SimHei\", \"黑体\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .ordering-row {\n    margin-bottom: 15px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .ordering-text {\n    width: 250px;\n  }\n  .answer-line {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;\n    flex-grow: 1;\n    margin-left: 10px;\n    padding-bottom: 2px;\n    min-height: 25px;\n  }\n  .page-number {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 30px;\n    left: 30px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-family: sans-serif;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"page-container\">\n  <div class=\"header-tag\">语文</div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-header\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Icon: 知识加油站]</div>\n    知识加油站\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    一、认识“濒”字，按要求作答，将序号填在括号里。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    1. “濒”字的读音最可能是哪一项？（ <span class=\"handwritten\">C</span> ）\n    <div class=\"options-row\">\n      <span>A. bù</span>\n      <span>B. shè</span>\n      <span>C. bīn</span>\n      <span>D. yè</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    2. “濒”，会意字，本义为水边。“濒”还有多个引申义，下列哪一项引申义不正确？（ <span class=\"handwritten\">B</span> ）\n    <div class=\"options-row\">\n      <span>A. 临近</span>\n      <span>B. 走进</span>\n      <span>C. 紧靠</span>\n      <span>D. 接近</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    二、选择恰当的修辞手法填入括号里。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pill-container\">\n    <div class=\"pill\">比喻</div>\n    <div class=\"pill\">拟人</div>\n    <div class=\"pill\">对偶</div>\n    <div class=\"pill\">反问</div>\n    <div class=\"pill\">设问</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    1. 空旷的花园里，烧焦的树垂头丧气地弯着腰。（ <span class=\"handwritten\">拟人</span> ）\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    2. 那双手就像鹰的爪子，扭着雨来的两只耳朵，向两边拉。（ <span class=\"handwritten\">比喻</span> ）\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    3. 怎么会就剩下我一个？这里有麻雀、乌鸦、猫头鹰，多着呢。（ <span class=\"handwritten\">设问</span> ）\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    4. 日出江花红胜火，春来江水绿如蓝。（ <span class=\"handwritten\">对偶</span> ）\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    三、把下列词语按一定顺序排列起来。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"ordering-row\">\n    <div class=\"ordering-text\">1. 植物 果树 梨树 树</div>\n    <div class=\"answer-line\"><span class=\"handwritten\">植物 : 树 : 果树 : 梨树</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ordering-row\">\n    <div class=\"ordering-text\">2. 开花 发芽 长叶 结果</div>\n    <div class=\"answer-line\"><span class=\"handwritten\">发芽 → 长叶 → 开花 → 结果</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ordering-row\">\n    <div class=\"ordering-text\">3. 清晨 黄昏 晌午 子夜</div>\n    <div class=\"answer-line\"><span class=\"handwritten\">清晨 → 晌午 → 黄昏 → 子夜</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-header\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Icon: 拓展新视窗]</div>\n    拓展新视窗\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    四、写出下列语句中破折号表示的意思。\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    1. 只是觉得它们好看——不是一般的好看，而是特别的好看。（ <span class=\"handwritten\">解释说明</span> ）\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    2. 我们——爱——自己的——祖国。（ <span class=\"handwritten\">说话的断断续续</span> ）\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"question-block\">\n    3. “呜——呜——”小女孩大声哭了起来。（ <span class=\"handwritten\">声音的延长</span> ）\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"page-number\">23</div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
